.TH TAI64NLOCAL 1 "2026-07-23" "rgbdns 0.2.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
tai64nlocal \- convert TAI64N timestamps to local time
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B tai64nlocal
.SH DESCRIPTION
Copies standard input to standard output, replacing a TAI64N timestamp at the
start of each line with a human-readable local timestamp. No arguments are
accepted.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR tai64n (1),
.BR multilog (1)
